# --- The live save directory --------------------------------------------------
# live/ is what the game actually reads (Saves/Save0 symlinks here). Its .py files
# are deployed copies of saves/<category>/, so tracking them would double-count the
# source of truth. It also holds two game-owned files that must never be tracked:
#   save.json       live game state; a tracked copy means a checkout could clobber
#                   a live save. We never read it and never write it.
#   __builtins__.py regenerated by the game; the reviewed snapshot is docs/api/.
live/*
!live/.gitkeep

# --- Archives -----------------------------------------------------------------
**.zip

# --- Capture artifacts --------------------------------------------------------
logs/**/*.png
logs/**/*.jpg
logs/**/*.txt
!logs/.gitkeep
